# Pin line endings. This repo is served as static files to a PS5 browser, and the
# working tree lives on Windows where core.autocrlf rewrites LF -> CRLF on checkout.
# That churn already produced a 2321-line "diff" on p2jb.html that was pure line
# endings and masked the real changes underneath. Force LF everywhere so the bytes
# GitHub Pages serves are the bytes that were tested.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.elf binary
*.bin binary
*.zip binary
